<p>Unleash raw, chaotic elemental damage upon your enemy.</p><p>You strike your enemy for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">155%, 170%, 181%, 191%, 200%</acronym> weapon damage in one of blinding sand, disarming acid, freezing and slowing ice, dazing lightning or stunning flames, with equal odds.</p><p>Additionally, you will cause a burst that deals <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>mindpower 100">140, 188, 226, 258, 286</acronym> of that damage to creatures in radius <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1, 2, 2, 3, 3,</acronym> regardless of if you hit with the blow.</p><p>Levels in Prismatic Slash increase your Physical and Mental attack speeds by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2%, 4%, 6%, 8%, 10%.</acronym></p><p></p><p>This talent will also attack with your shield, if you have one equipped.</p>